stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED: User Creates Agent Principal
    CREATED --> VERIFIED: HMAC Secret Keys Issued
    VERIFIED --> ACTIVE: Policy Limits Assigned
    ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED: Anomaly Detected / Emergency Stop
    ACTIVE --> REVOKED: Human User Revokes Agent
    SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE: Human Re-verifies Agent
    SUSPENDED --> REVOKED: Revocation Confirmed
    REVOKED --> [*]: Sub-10ms Cache Purge Complete
